Build Mantle from its own source (self-hosting)

Usage: mantle self-build [OPTIONS]

Options:
  -j, --jobs <JOBS>
          Maximum concurrent builds (default: CPU count, max 16)
  -v, --verbose
          Enable verbose logging
      --log-level <LOG_LEVEL>
          Log level (trace, debug, info, warn, error)
      --no-substitute
          Disable remote binary cache substitution
      --json
          Emit errors as JSON objects for tooling integration
      --no-verify
          Skip verification of the output binary
      --signing-key <SIGNING_KEY>
          Path to a Nix-format ed25519 signing keypair file
      --store <STORE>
          Where to export final build outputs on disk. Intermediate deps stay in castore. Source inputs always come from /nix/store. If not writable, builds still succeed (outputs in castore) [default: /nix/store]
      --store-prefix <STORE_PREFIX>
          Logical store path prefix for derivation hashes. All output paths and ATerm hashes are computed against this prefix. Default: /mantle/store. Use --nix-compat for /nix/store [default: /mantle/store]
      --trusted-public-keys <TRUSTED_PUBLIC_KEYS>
          Trusted public keys for signature verification (name:base64)
      --nix-compat
          Shorthand for --store-prefix=/nix/store. For interop testing with Nix-computed derivations
      --trust-unsigned
          Accept unsigned/unverified PathInfo on cache hits
      --state-dir <STATE_DIR>
          State directory for pathinfo.redb, blobs, and logs. Default: legacy $CRUNCH_STATE_DIR or $XDG_STATE_HOME/crunch or ~/.local/state/crunch. Use --state-dir for an explicit Mantle path
      --strict-hermetic
          Reject degraded hermetic behavior once strict-mode blockers exist
      --impure
          Permit ambient host dependencies; outputs are not proof-eligible
      --remote-binding-config <REMOTE_BINDING_CONFIG>
          Operator-owned endpoint binding configuration for production remote operations
      --no-host-tools
          Require stage0 to use only declared inventory seed tools
      --store-backend <STORE_BACKEND>
          Durable store backend (snix or casita) [default: snix]
      --base-store <BASE_STORES>
          Ordered list of read-only base store state directories for overlay composition. Declared in priority order (base A before base B)
      --stage0-inventory <STAGE0_INVENTORY>
          Stage0 executable/source seed inventory for --no-host-tools
      --offline-source-manifest-blake3 <OFFLINE_SOURCE_MANIFEST_BLAKE3>
          Require all builtin fetches to resolve from this pinned full-proof source manifest BLAKE3
      --offline-source-state-dir <OFFLINE_SOURCE_STATE_DIR>
          Read the pinned full-proof source closure from this independently hydrated source-only state
      --source-built-fixed-point
          Construct the full source lineage and prove the Cargo-free Mantle fixed point
      --prepare-source-programs
          Publish a new authenticated source-program cohort without executing a proof
      --source-profile <SOURCE_PROFILE>
          Authenticated source-built-fixed-point source profile
      --expected-source-profile-blake3 <EXPECTED_SOURCE_PROFILE_BLAKE3>
          Independently authenticated BLAKE3 of --source-profile
      --expected-stagex-lineage-blake3 <EXPECTED_STAGEX_LINEAGE_BLAKE3>
          Independently authenticated StageX lineage-manifest BLAKE3
      --expected-native-provider-blake3 <EXPECTED_NATIVE_PROVIDER_BLAKE3>
          Independently authenticated normalized native-provider tree BLAKE3
      --proof-bwrap <PROOF_BWRAP>
          Explicit bubblewrap executable used by the native construction shell
      --proof-sandbox-shell <PROOF_SANDBOX_SHELL>
          Explicit static sandbox shell used by native derivations
      --proof-elapsed-seconds-max <PROOF_ELAPSED_SECONDS_MAX>
          Maximum proof elapsed time recorded in the immutable plan [default: 86400]
      --proof-disk-bytes-max <PROOF_DISK_BYTES_MAX>
          Maximum proof disk bytes recorded in the immutable plan [default: 1099511627776]
      --proof-exec-events-max <PROOF_EXEC_EVENTS_MAX>
          Maximum protected exec decisions recorded in the immutable plan [default: 262144]
      --proof-source-records-max <PROOF_SOURCE_RECORDS_MAX>
          Maximum native source records recorded in the immutable plan [default: 65536]
      --dev-provider-cache <DEV_PROVIDER_CACHE>
          Opt-in dev-only provider-output cache and store snapshot directory
      --dev-resume
          Resume a dev run from verified bundles in the explicit dev provider-cache directory
      --dev-fast-fail
          Fast-fail a dev run when the current source profile is unchanged
      --cargo-free
          Build Mantle through native Rust topology execution without invoking Cargo
      --fixed-point
          Run the bounded Cargo-free stage1/stage2 fixed-point proof
      --out <OUT>
          Output directory for evidence, or a new source cohort with --prepare-source-programs
      --rustc <RUSTC>
          rustc executable for --cargo-free topology execution [default: rustc]
      --toolchain-closure <TOOLCHAIN_CLOSURE>
          Source-built toolchain closure manifest for --cargo-free proof input validation
      --rust-source-provider <RUST_SOURCE_PROVIDER>
          Validated source-built Rust provider directory for --cargo-free rustc binding
      --target <TARGETS>
          Target triple for --cargo-free rust-plan execution; repeatable
  -h, --help
          Print help
